"hoʻokomo i kahi prefix honua (e laʻa, +358).\n"
"\n"
"Inā waiho ʻole ʻia, e hoʻāʻo ka ʻōnaehana e ʻike maʻalahi iā ia mai kāu "
"kāleka SIM a i ʻole pūnaewele.\n"
"\n"
"Hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻopau lima iā ia ma ʻaneʻi ma ke hoʻokomo ʻana i kahi code "
"ʻāpana ISO 2-hua (e laʻa, US, FI, DE) a i ʻole he code kelepona (e laʻa."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:332
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"ʻO ke kani kani ka leo i hoʻokani ʻia (toot-toot-toot) oiai e kali ana no ka "
"pane ʻana i waho. ʻAʻole hoʻopuka kekahi mau mea lawe ia no laila ua loaʻa "
"iā mākou ke koho e hana lima ia ma aneʻi. \n"
"\n"
"Hiki iā ʻoe ke koho i kāu faila mele ponoʻī, a i ʻole e hoʻomaʻemaʻe iā ia e "
"hoʻohana i ka leo ʻōnaehana maʻamau."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:352
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "E koho i ka Ringback Tone"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:360
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Nā waihona leo"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:386
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"E koho i nā puke helu wahi e hoʻohana ai me Telephony a hoʻonohonoho iā "
"lākou e like me ka mea nui. ʻO ka puke helu helu kiʻekiʻe ka mea nui loa a "
"makemake ʻia inā loaʻa kekahi helu ma nā puke helu he nui. Hiki iā ʻoe ke "
"hoʻohana i ka Duplicate Resolver toggle ma lalo nei e kōkua i ka hoʻokele "
"ʻana i nā kope, akā inā ʻaʻole paʻa, paipai mākou e ʻae iā ia no kahi ʻike "
"maikaʻi aʻe."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:405
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Ke hoʻohana ʻia, inā e kāhea ka helu kelepona iā ʻoe i 3 mau manawa i loko o "
"5 mau minuke, ʻo ke kolu o ke kelepona (a me nā mea aʻe i loko o ka puka "
"aniani) e koi i ke kelepona e kani i ka leo kiʻekiʻe loa, e kāpae ana i nā "
"mode Silent or Do Not Disturb."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:417
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"E koho i nā hoapili e pāʻani mau i nā leka hoʻomaopopo i ka leo piha, ʻoiai "
"ke kelepona ʻana i ke ʻano Silent a i ʻole Do Disturb mode."

